From a6534c005eaae3d37dcc05c70bf18a9d267142ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fengshuai <shuai.feng@sunmi.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:03:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] fix(goal): scope streaks and denial budgets to the goal
 in charge

goal-progress-guard keeps the no-progress trail on one goal id, so a superseded goal's streak can neither annotate nor block the goal now being continued. goal-completion-gate bounds how many times a single agent is denied before the completion is admitted with a recorded warning, because a denial settles as an errored tool result and would otherwise hold the turn open forever.

One non-null event index read replaced with an undefined guard; no behavior change.
